[{"id":2492874748,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Ulj_8","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_csg_2d.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18082748/test_csg_2d.zip)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f71ab3b-8a30-49f7-8597-6225e51368da)\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- When **Use Vertex Color** is disabled, the CSG node will have a different appearance in the editor compared to the running project:\r\n\r\nEditor | Running project\r\n-|-\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68dd43ab-348a-4ac8-b0c2-d15ed314a423) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4661131a-5547-46e5-9825-ab2762db2ab0)\r\n\r\nWhen enabled, it has the same appearance in the editor and running project. I'm guessing this may occur because when **Use Vertex Color** is disabled, the shape is still drawn in white but is drawn *behind* the debug gizmos.\r\n\r\n- When **Use Vertex Color** is disabled, the Vertex Color property should be hidden in the inspector.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99911#pullrequestreview-2492874748","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99911","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2024-12-10T16:24:26Z"},{"id":2492940210,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Ulz-y","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/